diagnostics/field-default-uses-self.em:3:28: a field default cannot use `self` as a whole
      var label: String = "#{self}"
                             ^^^^
A default runs while the value is still being built, so it can read only the earlier fields it needs, as in `self.width`.
diagnostics/field-default-uses-self.em:4:26: a field default cannot call a method on `self`
      var area: Int = self.measure()
                           ^^^^^^^
A default runs while the value is still being built, so it can read only the earlier fields it needs, as in `self.width`.
